OL,3,GNEWSAThe unassuming cottage helping
OL,4,Aveterans to 'belong'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom the outside, it looks like an
OL,7,Fordinary cottage in keeping with other
OL,8,Fproperties in Corby Old Village.
OL,10,FAnd even when you step inside, the
OL,11,Flarge living room with sofas, a TV and
OL,12,Fa kitchen does not feel out of the
OL,13,Fordinary.
OL,15,FBut there is something special about
OL,16,Fthe rooms, as many of the people who
OL,17,Fpop in for a cup of tea can attest to.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
